1 2 [c] - A Virologist has authenticated themselves within iTrust2. UC2
2 3 [s] hcp A Virologist, a type HCP, uploads a list of passenger data . The Virologist can select between various plot or graph options representing the dataset . An error message will be displayed if a list of passenger data has not yet been uploaded .
